target_text:
{"question": "The cost per unit of electricity during a 4 year period is as follows:
Year 1, $2 per unit;
Year 2, $3 per unit;
Year 3, $4 per unit;
Year 4, $5 per unit.
If a factory spent equal dollars on electricity each year, what was the average cost of a unit of electricity during the 4 year period?", "options": {"A": "$3.82", "B": "$3.62", "C": "$5.12", "D": "$3.12"}, "correct_answer": "D"}
